WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.432 --> 00:00:16.036
"Wow! A raccoon!"

2
00:00:16.496 --> 00:00:17.136
Ezra said.

3
00:00:17.156 --> 00:00:20.197
"Hey, that's my candy!"

4
00:00:20.557 --> 00:00:21.237
Glen yelled.

5
00:00:21.257 --> 00:00:25.639
"Oops. I must have dropped some," Ivy said.

6
00:00:26.539 --> 00:00:30.000
The kids watched in amazement as the raccoon tore off the wrapper.

7
00:00:30.664 --> 00:00:32.865
Then it ate the candy and ran off into the woods.

8
00:00:36.567 --> 00:00:37.727
Ivy started laughing.

9
00:00:37.747 --> 00:00:42.989
"The raccoon was probably the candy thief in your cabin too!"

10
00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:47.891
Glen ran and grabbed the wrapper.

11
00:00:47.911 --> 00:00:52.333
"I always knew it was a raccoon that broke into the cabin.

12
00:00:53.794 --> 00:00:56.695
I could tell right away from how the screen was torn open."

13
00:00:58.175 --> 00:00:59.376
Ezra's eyes narrowed.

14
00:01:00.272 --> 00:01:04.054
"If you knew it was a raccoon, why didn't you tell us?"

15
00:01:04.074 --> 00:01:09.237
"Um Glen laughed.

16
00:01:09.257 --> 00:01:11.698
"I guess I forgot to mention it."

17
00:01:13.839 --> 00:01:16.281
"Too bad it wasn't a bear," Ivy said.

18
00:01:16.301 --> 00:01:19.442
"Do you think a bear could eat all three Ucks?

19
00:01:20.963 --> 00:01:24.085
Probably not, because Ucks taste yucky!"

20
00:01:25.966 --> 00:01:28.587
The friends laughed as they walked to the lodge for lunch.

21
00:01:35.464 --> 00:01:39.465
After lunch, Private announced that everyone should report to the tennis courts.

22
00:01:43.106 --> 00:01:46.187
The campers picked up balls and rackets from the equipment shed.

23
00:01:47.407 --> 00:01:49.008
Then they started toward the courts.

24
00:01:51.568 --> 00:01:53.149
Ivy suddenly stopped walking.

25
00:01:53.169 --> 00:01:56.850
"Wait, first a baseball game in the hot sun.

26
00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:00.631
And now there are tennis matches all afternoon?"

27
00:02:01.991 --> 00:02:02.851
She shook her head.

28
00:02:02.871 --> 00:02:04.492
"I'm not going."

29
00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:06.920
"You have to go."

30
00:02:07.701 --> 00:02:08.981
Glen waved his racket.

31
00:02:09.881 --> 00:02:12.862
"I can't wait to show my Evergreen spirit on the tennis court!"

32
00:02:12.882 --> 00:02:19.464
"I can barely stand one sport per day," Ivy said.

33
00:02:19.484 --> 00:02:23.105
"I'll skip tennis and think about ways to get back at the Ucks."

34
00:02:24.605 --> 00:02:28.326
"We're not allowed to skip activities," Ezra said.

35
00:02:28.346 --> 00:02:30.547
"What if you get in trouble?"

36
00:02:30.567 --> 00:02:33.668
"I won't get in trouble if I don't get caught."

37
00:02:37.712 --> 00:02:41.755
Ivy put a finger to her lips and slipped behind the shed, out of sight.

38
00:02:44.297 --> 00:02:48.260
Once everyone had left for tennis, Ivy checked to make sure she was alone.

39
00:02:49.841 --> 00:02:53.003
Then she took her sketch pad and sat under a big tree.

40
00:02:54.224 --> 00:02:58.447
Ivy leaned against the tree trunk, opened the sketch pad, and started to draw.

41
00:03:00.889 --> 00:03:05.232
It was a great way to spend the afternoon, but suddenly she heard voices.

42
00:03:06.236 --> 00:03:09.039
She looked up to see Mango and Larry coming her way.

43
00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:12.802
They were talking together, so they hadn't seen her.

44
00:03:14.404 --> 00:03:16.125
Ivy ducked behind the tree to hide.

45
00:03:16.145 --> 00:03:21.951
"Mrs. Matsak wants us to move the bear statue tonight," Mango was saying.

46
00:03:21.971 --> 00:03:26.195
"It needs to be in the square for the big ceremony tomorrow morning.

47
00:03:27.296 --> 00:03:31.760
The statue is so lifelike—a masterpiece of nature art!"

48
00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:36.363
"You mean, we have to, like, move that big thing?"

49
00:03:36.823 --> 00:03:37.524
Larry asked.

50
00:03:37.544 --> 00:03:40.306
"Isn't it, like, really heavy?"

51
00:03:41.887 --> 00:03:42.688
Mango shrugged.

52
00:03:42.708 --> 00:03:44.970
"It's probably no big deal.

53
00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:47.132
And it won't take us very long.

54
00:03:48.272 --> 00:03:52.116
When we're done, we can chill out watch the stars or something."

55
00:03:53.877 --> 00:03:57.019
The two counselors walked past the tree and were soon out of sight.

56
00:03:59.562 --> 00:04:02.264
Ivy peeked around the tree with a thoughtful look on her face.

57
00:04:04.508 --> 00:04:06.989
Then she smiled and started drawing again.

58
00:04:09.309 --> 00:04:12.930
Ivy was still under the tree when Ezra and Glen returned from tennis.

59
00:04:12.950 --> 00:04:17.492
"Gross. You guys look hot and sweaty.

60
00:04:18.772 --> 00:04:19.492
How was tennis?"

61
00:04:20.993 --> 00:04:22.413
Ezra sat down beside her.

62
00:04:22.433 --> 00:04:26.414
"I only got called Snuggy Wuggy 15 times."

63
00:04:28.315 --> 00:04:30.515
Ivy noticed a red mark on Glen's forehead.

64
00:04:30.535 --> 00:04:32.796
"What happened to you?"

65
00:04:34.036 --> 00:04:35.317
Glen rubbed his forehead.

66
00:04:35.337 --> 00:04:38.000
"Huck hit me with his serve."

67
00:04:42.544 --> 00:04:45.447
had a much better time than you did," Ivy said.

68
00:04:45.467 --> 00:04:48.069
"I've figured out a way to scare the Ucks!"

69
00:04:49.671 --> 00:04:52.113
She held up her sketch pad to show them her drawing.

70
00:04:52.133 --> 00:04:54.935
"Here's what we're going to do
